#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hierarchy: subject → world → content"
msgstr "层级：subject → world → content"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer       | Entity type     | Role                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Subject** | `agent`, `user` | Who acts — exists **before** and **outside** worlds |\n"
"| **World**   | `world`         | Logical namespace / permission boundary             |\n"
"| **Content** | `content`       | Business data (tasks, future memory components, …)  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层          | 实体类型        | 作用                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Subject** | `agent`, `user` | 行动者——存在于 world **之前**且**之外**             |\n"
"| **World**   | `world`         | 逻辑命名空间 / 权限边界                             |\n"
"| **Content** | `content`       | 业务数据（任务、未来记忆组件等）                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:18
msgid ""
"Subjects do **not** belong to a world. Each subject may have exactly **one "
"default private world** (exclusive, auto-created on subject creation). "
"Content belongs to a world via `world_id` and inherits that world's "
"visibility boundary."
msgstr ""
"Subject **不**属于某个 world。每个 subject 可有且仅有**一个默认私有 world**"
"（独占，创建 subject 时自动创建）。Content 通过 `world_id` 归属 world，并继承"
"该 world 的可见性边界。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two orthogonal classifications"
msgstr "两种正交分类"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer           | Cardinality              | Purpose                                                    |\n"
"| --------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Entity type** | 4 fixed values           | Architecture boundary: `content`, `world`, `agent`, `user` |\n"
"| **Components**  | Dynamic, many per entity | Functional markers: `task_list`, `task_item`, …            |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层              | 基数                     | 用途                                                       |\n"
"| --------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Entity type** | 4 个固定值               | 架构边界：`content`、`world`、`agent`、`user`              |\n"
"| **Components**  | 动态，每实体可多个       | 功能标记：`task_list`、`task_item` 等                      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Component fields live in **`body` JSONB** at the top level. "
#| "**`primary_component`** records the creation entry (usually immutable); "
#| "list views route by primary component."
msgid ""
"Component fields live in **`body` JSONB** at the top level. "
"**`primary_component`** records the creation entry / module routing facet; "
"it may become **null** when the entity has no components left (empty shell). "
"List views still route by primary when present."
msgstr ""
"组件字段位于顶层 **`body` JSONB**。`**primary_component**` 记录创建入口（通常"
"不可变）；列表视图按 primary component 路由。"

