#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:274
msgid ""
"Privacy fields live in `body.secrets_enc` + `body.dek_wrapped`. Plaintext "
"metadata: title, `url`, optional `uris[]` (`uri` + `match`), username, tags, "
"`custom_field_names`, optional `import_refs` (e.g. Bitwarden cipher UUID). "
"Secrets payload may include `password` / `totp` / `notes` / "
"`custom_fields` / structured `card` / `identity`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:276
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Revisions:** vault items participate in the entity-level `entities.revisions` allowlist (max 10 snapshots on substantive update). Shell `/vault` can list history and restore; see [`docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md`](../aspects/entity-revisions.md). Master-password change must rewrap current and historical `dek_wrapped`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:282
msgid ""
"**SAP:** `vault.*` — Shell defaults `subject_kind: user`; ToolSet defaults "
"agent world. History: `vault.history.list` / `vault.history.restore` (not "
"exposed to LLM ToolSet)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:282
msgid ""
"**UI:** shell `/vault` (`@freeanima/features/vault`); Bitwarden 未加密 JSON "
"导入（`import_refs.bitwarden` 幂等）；bundled Chat 有独立主密码解锁。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:282
msgid ""
"**Browser extension:** `src/portal/extension` — 直连 Habitat REST + 扩展内主"
"密码会话；见 [`docs/modules/vault.md`](../modules/vault.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:282
msgid ""
"**LLM:** ToolSet `vault` — Habitat-only (not MCP): metadata list/search/get; "
"`vault_create` / `vault_update` / `vault_delete` (Agent library seal for "
"create/update); credentials via `terminal_run` / `code_execute` `secrets[]` "
"(child env only) or `browser_type` `secret` (typed into page; redacted in "
"tool results); never plaintext secrets in tool results or Habitat "
"`process.env`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:282
msgid ""
"**Config:** Runtime PG settings may use `vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` "
"(Agent library) or `env(\"KEY\")` (legacy `credential()` removed). Bootstrap "
"`config.yaml` cannot resolve `vault()` — use `env()` or plaintext before "
"PostgreSQL is up."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:284
msgid ""
"Legacy pass (`~/.password-store`) is **not** deleted on disk; migrate "
"entries manually via Shell UI."
msgstr ""
"遗留 pass（`~/.password-store`）**不会从磁盘删除**；请经 Shell UI 手动迁移条"
"目。"

